## Definition of Done

Milestone 2b is complete when the database contains representative development projects, the NestJS API can reliably retrieve and filter published catalog data, source attribution and AI-estimate provenance are preserved, and all relevant validation checks pass.

The result should provide a clean backend foundation for building the public Tinker Index website in Milestone 3.